OL,3,GNEWSAPublishing house staff strike over
OL,4,Aoffshoring plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinancial staff at one of the UK's
OL,7,Flargest publishing houses have gone on
OL,8,Fstrike over proposals to outsource jobs
OL,9,Fto India.
OL,11,FOxford University Press (OUP) plans to
OL,12,Foffshore its financial operations
OL,13,Fdepartment to EXL Services, which will
OL,14,Fprovide the service from the
OL,15,Fsubcontinent.
OL,17,FMore than 30 Unite the Union members
OL,18,Fwalked out on Tuesday over the plans,
OL,19,Fwith the industrial action set to last
OL,20,Funtil 11 September.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
