OL,3,GNEWSAPublishing house staff strike over
OL,4,Aoffshoring plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response OUP said it was consulting
OL,7,Fwith staff to reach a resolution and
OL,8,Fthat fewer than half of those impacted
OL,9,Fby the changes had voted in favour of
OL,10,Fthe industrial action.
